    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Common</em></p><p>While holding this small brass compass, you can take a Magic action to orient it to your current location; from then on, its needle always points toward that place. The compass can be oriented to only one location at a time, and you can clear its orientation as a Magic action. While it isn’t oriented to a location, or while it’s on a different plane of existence from that location, its needle spins aimlessly.</p>",
